(no d2mu_lR_dnl2 line exists in this function). In applyFilmPressureMicroPotential, applyMacroFloorCutoff(out, ...) is called at line 705 (mutating out.mu_lR/dmu_lR_dnl but leaving out.d2mu_lR_dnl2 as the raw, un-cutoff second derivative from computeVanDerWaalsMicroPotential), and then at lines 877-880:
    double const Pi = -rho_lR_used * out.mu_lR;            // Pa (disjoining)
    double const dPi_dnl = -rho_lR_used * out.dmu_lR_dnl;  // Pa per n_l = Pi'
    double const d2Pi_dnl2 =
        -rho_lR_used * out.d2mu_lR_dnl2;  // Pa per n_l^2 = Pi''
Pi and Pi' are built from the g_cut-scaled mu_lR/dmu_lR_dnl, but Pi'' is built from the un-cut raw d2mu_lR_dnl2. The same pattern recurs in the strained-film branch: line 844 chain-scales strained.d2mu_lR_dnl2 by dw_eff_dnl^2, then applyMacroFloorCutoff(strained, ...) is called at line 845 (again not touching d2mu_lR_dnl2), and line 858 copies the still-uncut value into out.d2mu_lR_dnl2 (`out.d2mu_lR_dnl2 = strained.d2mu_lR_dnl2;  // J/kg per n_l^2`).

